R16 line 40
When checkout is started and stock is available, the Checkout shall the billed seats is 3.

They clash when the cart was not open, an item was not added, checkout was started, payment was not submitted, payment was not declined, the address was not confirmed, the customer was not subscribing, the customer was not cancelling, the customer was not signed in, a card was not saved, and stock was available.
R15 requires that the billed seats was at most 2.
R16 requires that the billed seats was 3.

